    "name": "Rubino Tequila Spritz",
    "instructions": "1. Combine the first 3 ingredients in a shaker with ice. Shake and strain into a chilled glass with fresh ice. Top with blood orange soda and Prosecco, then garnish.",
    "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:11:40+00:00",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-21T09:11:40+00:00",
    "description": "“The intention behind the Rubino Spritz was to bridge the gap between the palates and desires of our Knoxville audience and our authentic northern Italian brand,” explains Madison Walker, bar manager at Brother Wolf. The ruby-hued spritz complements earthy tequila with the floral and citrus notes of Italian bergamot liqueur Italicus, all amplified by the juicy sweetness of blood orange soda. “The drink is truly a marriage of our identities: Knoxville and Italy.”",
